constructor
  ├── it should set the spoke and discovered reserve id
  ├── when vault is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when spoke is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when the reserve is not found
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when a duplicate reserve is found
      └── it should revert
